title: Marisol_Greeting
tags: character:Marisol moon:1 beat:village role:weaver
---
<<tag character:Marisol>>
Marisol: I'd weave longer if the light held — bring back the dome and I'll teach you the cymatic warp.
-> Continue
    <<jump Marisol_Exit>>
===

title: Marisol_Exit
tags: character:Marisol moon:1 beat:village
---
<<tag character:Marisol>>
Marisol: The loom will still be here.
===

title: Tobias_Greeting
tags: character:Tobias moon:1 beat:village role:elder
---
<<tag character:Tobias>>
Tobias: Heard the bells once, when I was small. They'll ring again.
-> Continue
    <<jump Tobias_Exit>>
===

title: Tobias_Exit
tags: character:Tobias moon:1 beat:village
---
<<tag character:Tobias>>
Tobias: Sit a spell, when your work's done.
